Subject: [PATCH] fix: apply the november review fixes (1.2.6)

Fixes from the review of the ha-* repositories (juju35/ha-review).

- `SECURITY.md`: how to report a vulnerability privately.
- Idle states use the theme's secondary text colour (`--secondary-text-color`), like every ha-* card.
- Biome 2.6.8, like the other ha-* repos (schema and pre-commit).
- Items away, with a low battery or not seen: the tile background stays neutral, the tinted icon, border and state show it (card charter).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01F4sAn1x21MmgHHeW1MLKJ5
